Title:          MSA
Version:        1.0.12a
Entered-date:   2019-11-11
Description:    An x86 assembler
Summary:        MSA is an x86 assembler that supports all 8086 instructions and most of the 80186/80286 instructions. MSA outputs flat binary output (.COM) files.
Keywords:       assembler, asm, msa
